WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.001
Start a private fictional workshop assessment. (3× speed)

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:01.285
Name the private fictional workshop activity. (3× speed)

00:00:01.285 --> 00:00:11.249
Enter the approved short facts and three-question task. (3× speed)

00:00:11.249 --> 00:00:11.926
Luna generates three basic question types from the approved short facts. (4× speed)

00:00:11.926 --> 00:00:19.104
Review the three proposed basic question types.

00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:19.779
Add the three reviewed questions to the private activity

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:20.542
Remove the model answer from the student question.

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:26.126
Focus the answer field

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:26.357
Set an expected answer before testing the actual grading behavior.

00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:31.369
Focus the answer field

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:31.421
Remove the optional hints from this independent check.

00:00:31.421 --> 00:00:32.930
Remove a generated free-response hint

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:33.798
Check the correct option, then remove the remaining optional hints.

00:00:33.798 --> 00:00:35.186
Inspect the multiple-choice key below the fixed toolbar

00:00:35.186 --> 00:00:36.692
Remove an optional multiple-choice hint

00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:38.183
Inspect the drawing question settings

00:00:38.183 --> 00:00:39.105
Remove an optional drawing hint

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.097
Keep only the requested drawing response.

00:00:40.097 --> 00:00:41.524
Inspect the generated drawing settings

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:45.170
Disable the optional extra show-work response

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:45.556
Try the three response formats in student preview.

00:00:45.556 --> 00:00:46.232
Open the actual student preview

00:00:46.232 --> 00:00:46.551
Open the fictional student attempt in Preview.

00:00:46.551 --> 00:00:47.712
Start the three-question preview

00:00:47.712 --> 00:00:48.378
Read the first question

00:00:48.378 --> 00:00:48.696
Try an answer, reconsider fixed parameters, and revise it.

00:00:48.696 --> 00:00:51.484
Try the common parameters misconception

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:52.482
Mark the uncertain response for review

00:00:52.482 --> 00:00:54.862
Revise the answer to available context

00:00:54.862 --> 00:00:55.457
Continue to the written explanation

00:00:55.457 --> 00:00:55.760
Explain how context changes while learned parameters stay fixed.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:01:03.115
Focus the answer field

00:01:03.115 --> 00:01:03.817
Continue to the drawing response

00:01:03.817 --> 00:01:04.077
Open the native drawing response and build the flow.

00:01:04.077 --> 00:01:05.559
Open the native drawing canvas

00:01:05.559 --> 00:01:06.238
Widen the actual drawing canvas

00:01:06.238 --> 00:01:06.954
Choose native text labels

00:01:06.954 --> 00:01:07.638
Place the first flow label on the native canvas

00:01:07.638 --> 00:01:09.414
Focus the answer field

00:01:09.414 --> 00:01:10.007
Commit the first label

00:01:10.007 --> 00:01:10.524
Choose the next text label

00:01:10.524 --> 00:01:10.824
Place the inference label

00:01:10.824 --> 00:01:12.977
Focus the answer field

00:01:12.977 --> 00:01:13.538
Commit the inference text

00:01:13.538 --> 00:01:14.048
Choose the output label tool

00:01:14.048 --> 00:01:14.336
Place the next-token output

00:01:14.336 --> 00:01:15.755
Focus the answer field

00:01:15.755 --> 00:01:16.087
Commit the output text

00:01:16.087 --> 00:01:16.387
Add the explanatory note

00:01:16.387 --> 00:01:16.688
Place the note below the flow

00:01:16.688 --> 00:01:20.228
Focus the answer field

00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:20.891
Commit the explanatory note

00:01:20.891 --> 00:01:21.767
Choose a native directional arrow

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:25.379
Select single-headed arrows

00:01:25.379 --> 00:01:28.556
Review the completed flow

00:01:28.556 --> 00:01:29.289
Save the fictional drawing in preview

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:29.322
Review the completed preview before submitting.

00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:30.004
Submit only the fictional preview attempt

00:01:30.004 --> 00:01:30.366
Return to the marked question and confirm the corrected answer.

00:01:30.366 --> 00:01:31.171
Review the marked question first

00:01:31.171 --> 00:01:36.814
Return to the corrected choice

00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:38.408
Confirm the corrected choice and remove the marker

00:01:38.408 --> 00:01:39.027
Return to the completed drawing

00:01:39.027 --> 00:01:40.006
Submit the fictional preview only

00:01:40.006 --> 00:01:40.925
Confirm the fictional preview submission

00:01:40.925 --> 00:01:41.088
A valid explanation is marked Incorrect: inspect the exact-match grading.

00:01:41.088 --> 00:01:44.042
Inspect the written-answer feedback

00:01:44.042 --> 00:01:44.989
Use teacher review for a semantically correct written explanation.

00:01:44.989 --> 00:01:45.656
Inspect the written-answer grading settings

00:01:45.656 --> 00:01:45.976
Clear the exact-match key and preserve expected meaning for teacher review.

00:01:45.976 --> 00:01:48.535
Focus the answer field

00:01:48.535 --> 00:01:49.629
Keep expected meaning in teacher-only instructions

00:01:49.629 --> 00:02:01.109
Focus the answer field

00:02:01.109 --> 00:02:01.664
Close the private teacher instructions

00:02:01.664 --> 00:02:02.296
Recheck preview after removing exact-match grading

00:02:02.296 --> 00:02:02.519
Retry the same completed preview after the grading change.

00:02:02.519 --> 00:02:03.266
Retry with the preserved fictional responses

00:02:03.266 --> 00:02:04.904
Confirm the preview retry

00:02:04.904 --> 00:02:07.450
Q1 scores 1/1; written and drawing responses remain ungraded.

00:02:07.450 --> 00:02:09.691
Verify the same written explanation now awaits review

00:02:09.691 --> 00:02:10.092
Inspect the activity’s native sharing and export options.

00:02:10.092 --> 00:02:11.422
Open the activity menu

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.027
Open the native printable assessment

00:02:12.027 --> 00:02:12.479
Create the native blank assessment for use without the author session.

00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:12.934
Choose the blank assessment handout

00:02:12.934 --> 00:02:13.921
Build the printable native handout

00:02:13.921 --> 00:02:16.878
Revisit the original sent task (1/4): short source facts and Q1.

00:02:16.878 --> 00:02:19.545
Revisit the original sent task (2/4): Q1 options and Q2.

00:02:19.545 --> 00:02:22.183
Revisit the original sent task (3/4): expected meaning and drawing flow.

00:02:22.183 --> 00:02:24.425
Revisit the original sent task (4/4): three types and fictional records only.

00:02:24.425 --> 00:02:26.667
Copy the actual printable assessment as a plain-text handout.
